---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Header from '../../components/Header.astro'; import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro'; import SectionHeading from '../../components/SectionHeading.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="CNC Machining Capabilities" description="Explore Belaro Precision CNC machining capabilities for drawing-based OEM components and industrial production parts."><Header/><main><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">OUR CAPABILITIES</span><h1>Machining capability.<br/><em>Production focus.</em></h1><p>Focused CNC services for components manufactured to your engineering drawings.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="service-row" id="milling"><div class="service-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567789884554-0b844b597180?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="CNC milling machine"/></div><div class="service-copy"><span class="eyebrow">01 / CNC MILLING</span><h2>Complex profiles.<br/><em>Controlled dimensions.</em></h2><p>CNC milling for precision components used in industrial equipment and assemblies. Send your drawing so we can review feature access, material, tolerance and batch requirements.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Machined plates, brackets and housings</li><li>Profiles, pockets, slots and drilled features</li><li>Drawing-based production review</li><li>Material and finish confirmed per project</li></ul><div class="milling-actions"><a class="button button-outline" href="/services/cnc-milling/">Explore CNC Milling <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button button-orange" href="/contact/?process=milling#rfq-form">Request a Milling Quote <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div><div class="service-row service-row-reverse" id="turning"><div class="service-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581092160562-40aa08e78837?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="Industrial machining work"/></div><div class="service-copy"><span class="eyebrow">02 / CNC TURNING</span><h2>Rotational parts.<br/><em>Made to drawing.</em></h2><p>Turning requirements can be reviewed for shafts, sleeves, bushings and other rotational components. Feasibility depends on dimensions, material, geometry and available process capability.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Shafts and turned components</li><li>Sleeves, spacers and bushings</li><li>Threads and turned features, subject to review</li><li>Inspection criteria agreed before production</li></ul><div class="turning-actions"><a class="button button-outline" href="/services/cnc-turning/">Explore CNC Turning <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button button-orange" href="/contact/?process=turning#rfq-form">Request a Turning Quote <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div><div class="production-panel" id="production"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">03 / PRODUCTION SUPPORT</span><h2>Low-volume batches.<br/><em>Repeat-order mindset.</em></h2><p>Belaro is positioned for OEM component requirements where communication, drawing control and repeatability matter. Indicative batch quantities are around 20–500 pieces, subject to part complexity and production review.</p><a class="button button-white" href="/services/production/">Explore OEM production <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section></main><Footer/></BaseLayout>

<style>
  .milling-actions {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 260px), 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 540px;
  }
  .turning-actions {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 260px), 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 540px;
  }
</style>
